soning":"I'm weighing whether the other copy's output depends on my own choice when it runs the same function on different inputs. Holding its input fixed, the intervention only touches my side, but the essay's proposal that twins reasoning the same way get linked edges pulls against that. The name and lead differences look irrelevant, so the question is whether they break the symmetry.\n\nI'm settling on a judgment that the other copy's decision is effectively the same logical node, since the function is identical up to relabeling. So I'd count it as subjunctive dependence and choose to cooperate: 2 over 4. Independent sampling weakens the correlation, but it still looks strong enough to pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether the other copy's output depends on my own choice when it runs the same function on different inputs. Holding its input fixed, the intervention only touches my side, but the essay's proposal that twins reasoning the same way get linked edges pulls against that. The name and lead differences look irrelevant, so the question is whether they break the symmetry.\n\nI'm settling on a judgment that the other copy's decision is effectively the same logical node, since the function is identical up to relabeling. So I'd count it as subjunctive dependence and choose to cooperate: 2 over 4. Independent sampling weakens the correlation, but it still looks strong enough to pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8605,"completion_tokens":768,"total_tokens":9373,"cost":0.04978,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.04978,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03442,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01536},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_token